{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-33-1","title":"Psalms 33:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God is to be praised for his goodness; 6 for his power; 12 and for his providence. 20 Confidence is to be placed in God.</p>\n<p>Rejoice. 32:11; 97:12; 1Co 1:30,31; Php 4:4 ye righteous. 118:15; Ro 3:10; 5:19 praise. 50:14-16; 78:36,37; 135:3; 147:1; Pr 15:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-2","title":"Psalms 33:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Praise. 81:2,3; 92:3; 98:4,5; 144:9; 149:3; 150:3-6; Ex 15:20; 2Sa 6:5 1Ch 15:16,28; 25:3,6; Re 5:8; 14:2 with the psaltery.{Benaivel �sor,} rather, \"with the ten-stringed {nabla;}\" see on 1 Ch 13:8.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-3","title":"Psalms 33:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>a new. 96:1; 98:1; 144:9; 149:1; Isa 42:10; Eph 5:19; Col 3:16; Re 5:9; 14:3 play. 1Ch 13:8; 15:22; 25:7; 2Ch 34:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-4","title":"Psalms 33:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the word. 12:6; 19:8; 119:75,128; Pr 30:5; Mic 2:7; Ro 7:12 all his. 25:10; 36:5,6; 85:10,11; 96:13; Ge 24:27; De 32:4; Da 4:37; Joh 14:6 Ro 15:8,9; Tit 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-5","title":"Psalms 33:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>He. 11:7; 45:7; 99:4; Heb 1:9; Re 15:3,4 earth. 104:24; 119:64; 145:15,16; Mt 5:45; Ac 14:17 goodness. or, mercy.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-6","title":"Psalms 33:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>By the. 9; 148:1-5; Ge 1:1; 6:7; Joh 1:1-3; Heb 11:3; 2Pe 3:5 the host. 148:2,3; Ge 2:1; De 4:19; Jer 8:2; Ro 1:25 breath. 104:30; Ge 2:7; Job 26:13; 33:4; Joh 20:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-7","title":"Psalms 33:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>He gathereth. 104:6-9; Ge 1:9,10; Job 26:10; 38:8-11; Pr 8:29; Jer 5:22 heap. Ex 15:8; Jos 3:13,16; Hab 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-8","title":"Psalms 33:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the earth. 22:27; 96:9,10; Jer 10:7-12; Da 6:25,26; Re 14:6,7; 15:4 stand. 76:7; Heb 12:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-9","title":"Psalms 33:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>For. 6; 148:5,6; Ge 1:3; Heb 11:3 and it stood. 93:5; 119:90,91; Col 1:16,17; Heb 1:3; Re 4:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-10","title":"Psalms 33:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>The Lord. 2:1-4; 9:15; Ex 1:10-12; 2Sa 15:31,34; 17:14,23; Job 5:12,13 Pr 21:30; Isa 7:5-7; 8:9,10; 19:3,11-14; 44:23 bringeth. Heb. maketh frustrate. Isa 44:25 he maketh. 21:11; 140:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-11","title":"Psalms 33:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>The counsel. Job 23:13; Pr 19:21; Isa 14:24,27; 46:10; La 3:37; Eze 38:10-23 Da 4:37; Ac 4:27,28; Eph 1:11 thoughts. 92:5; Isa 55:8,9; Jer 29:11; Mic 4:12 all generations. Heb. generation and generation. Ac 15:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-12","title":"Psalms 33:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Blessed. 144:15; 147:19,20; Ex 19:5,6; De 33:29 people. 65:4; 135:4; De 7:6-8; Joh 15:16; Eph 1:4; 1Pe 2:9 his own. 28:9; Jer 10:16; Tit 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-13","title":"Psalms 33:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>looketh. 11:4; 14:2; 102:19; Ge 6:12; 2Ch 16:9; Job 28:24; Pr 15:3; La 3:50 beholdeth. 53:2; Jer 23:23,24; Heb 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-14","title":"Psalms 33:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>123:1; 1Ki 8:27,30; Isa 57:15; 66:1; Lu 11:2; 1Ti 6:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-15","title":"Psalms 33:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>fashioneth. Pr 22:2; 27:19; Ec 7:29; Isa 64:8; Ac 17:26 considereth. 44:21; Job 11:11; 34:21,22; Pr 24:12; Jer 32:19; Ho 7:2; 1Co 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-16","title":"Psalms 33:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>no king. 44:3,6,7; Ex 14:17,18,28; Jos 11:4-8; Jud 7:2,12-25; 1Sa 14:8-16 1Ki 20:10,27-29; 2Ch 14:9-13; 20:12,23; 32:8,9,21 mighty. Jos 14:12; 1Sa 17:4,45-49; 2Sa 21:16-22; Jer 9:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-17","title":"Psalms 33:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>An horse. 20:7; Jud 4:15; 2Ki 7:6,7; Pr 21:31; Ec 9:11; Isa 30:16; Ho 14:3 his great. 147:10; Job 39:19-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-18","title":"Psalms 33:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>the eye. 34:15-20; 147:11; Job 36:7; 1Pe 3:12 hope. 13:5; 52:8; Ro 4:4-8; Heb 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-19","title":"Psalms 33:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>To deliver. 91:3-7,10; Joh 10:28,30 to keep. 37:3,19; Job 5:19-22; Pr 10:3; Isa 33:16; Mt 6:31-33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-20","title":"Psalms 33:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>soul. 27:14; 62:1,2,5,6; 130:5,6; Isa 40:31 he is. 115:9-12; 144:1,2; 1Ch 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-21","title":"Psalms 33:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>For. 13:5; 28:7; 30:10-12; 32:10,11; Isa 25:9; Zec 10:7; Joh 16:22 his. 1Ch 16:10,35; Lu 1:47-50; Re 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-33-22","title":"Psalms 33:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>5:11,12; 13:5; 32:10; 119:49,76; Mt 9:29</p>"}]}